wn  species and similarly shoot was  introduced as an unidentified beast  hunter which at face value  sounds very much like pockel's  designation but shoot study focused more  on the mythical paranormal and  supernatural entities turning to the  realm of medicine now we can identify  disease hunters a category that so far  only includes cheedle and sanbika the  latter of which is specifically  recognized as a virus hunter but i  suppose you could essentially call  this a branch of super science hunters  who have near limitless resources at  their disposal to focus on finding cures  for the various diseases that have  plagued humanity on the other end of the  spectrum we also have gourmet hunters  which are much more focused on  accentuating the pleasures of life  rather than providing the necessities to  live it gourmet hunters typically travel  the world in search of exotic  ingredients and furthering the world of  high-class cuisine a gourmet hunter is  of course  usually also a highly accomplished chef  in their own right with a  wildly sophisticated palette as we saw  in menchie although a gourmet hunted  need not be so demanding in this area as  seen in buhari also lynn or durv was  classified as a gourmet hunter which is  very interesting because she was a close  friend of isaac netro  and even traveled with him to the dark  continent so who knows what delicious  madness she picked up there and has  since applied to the world of cookery  now next up we have a very basic form of  hunting which would be treasure hunters  who obviously travel the world in search  of very valuable objects like biski who  dedicated her career specifically to  hunting precious stones  whilst kansai of the zodiacs has only  been described as more of a general  treasure hunter along the same lines  though we have the indiana joneses of  the hunthunter world being relicantes  not to be confused with the 1999 tier  career series reliconta or maybe it is  to be confused with it  because 